---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Accueil · NESDZ"
  description="NESDZ : briefing vol, journal utile et annuaire ULM pour préparer, comparer et voler plus juste."
>
  <section class="hero home-top-section">
    <div class="container home-top-grid">
      <article class="card home-hero-card">
        <div class="home-hero-mark" aria-hidden="true">
          <img src="/logo.png" alt="" loading="eager" />
        </div>

        <div class="home-kicker">Briefing vol · Journal · Annuaire ULM</div>

        <h1>Briefing vol, journal pilote et annuaire ULM.</h1>

        <p class="home-lead">
          NESDZ rassemble l’essentiel pour le pilote ULM : un briefing vol rapide
          pour préparer un départ, un journal pour mieux lire le terrain et la météo,
          et un annuaire pour comparer les machines avec des critères concrets.
        </p>

        <div class="home-hero-actions">
          <a class="btn home-primary-btn" href="/outils/">Ouvrir le briefing vol</a>
        </div>

        <div class="home-hero-links" aria-label="Accès secondaires NESDZ">
          <a href="/journal/">Voir le journal</a>
          <span aria-hidden="true">·</span>
          <a href="/modeles/">Voir l’annuaire ULM</a>
        </div>

        <p class="home-hero-note">
          Pour la préparation du vol, les services officiels en vigueur restent la référence.
        </p>
      </article>

      <aside class="card home-journal-card">
        <div class="pad">
          <div class="home-section-head">
            <div>
              <h2>Journal</h2>
              <p class="home-section-intro compact">
                Des articles pour voler plus fin, choisir plus juste et garder des marges.
              </p>
            </div>
            <a class="home-text-link" href="/journal/">Tout lire</a>
          </div>

          <ul class="home-article-list">
            <li class="home-article-item">
              <a class="home-article-link home-article-link--with-thumb" href="/journal/2026-01-edito-nesdz/">
                <div class="home-article-thumb">
                  <img src="/edito-esprit-ulm.png" alt="Édito du mois NESDZ" loading="lazy" />
                </div>
                <div class="home-article-copy">
                  <div class="home-article-meta">
                    <span class="home-article-highlight">Mis à jour</span>
                    <time datetime="2026-02-27T00:00:00.000Z">27 févr. 2026</time>
                  </div>
                  <h3>L’Esprit ULM : Manifeste pour un ciel libre et responsable</h3>
                  <p>
                    Pour le lancement de ce nouveau journal, nous explorons ce qui définit
                    l’essence profonde de l’aviation ultralégère.
                  </p>
                </div>
              </a>
            </li>

            <li class="home-article-item">
              <a class="home-article-link home-article-link--with-thumb" href="/journal/2026-02-choisir-ulm/">
                <div class="home-article-thumb">
                  <img src="/articles/bienchoisirsonulm.png" alt="Choisir son ULM" loading="lazy" />
                </div>
                <div class="home-article-copy">
                  <div class="home-article-meta">
                    <time datetime="2026-02-02T00:00:00.000Z">2 févr. 2026</time>
                  </div>
                  <h3>Choisir son ULM : une méthode simple (et anti-auto-mensonge)</h3>
                  <p>
                    Avant de regarder les photos, regarde ton usage : terrain, météo,
                    budget, maintenance et objectifs réels.
                  </p>
                </div>
              </a>
            </li>

            <li class="home-article-item">
              <a class="home-article-link home-article-link--with-thumb" href="/journal/2025-12-metrologie-du-vent/">
                <div class="home-article-thumb home-article-thumb--logo">
                  <img src="/logo.png" alt="NESDZ" loading="lazy" />
                </div>
                <div class="home-article-copy">
                  <div class="home-article-meta">
                    <time datetime="2025-12-14T00:00:00.000Z">14 déc. 2025</time>
                  </div>
                  <h3>Lire le vent comme un pilote (pas comme une appli)</h3>
                  <p>
                    Comprendre les indices du terrain pour décider vite, calmement
                    et sans illusion dangereuse.
                  </p>
                </div>
              </a>
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </aside>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="container home-model-section">
    <div class="card">
      <div class="pad">
        <div class="home-section-head">
          <div>
            <h2>Modèles en vedette</h2>
            <p class="home-section-intro compact">
              Quelques machines déjà enrichies pour repartir vite vers des comparaisons utiles.
            </p>
          </div>
          <a class="home-text-link" href="/modeles/">Voir l’annuaire ULM</a>
        </div>

        <div class="home-model-grid">
          <article class="home-model-card">
            <a class="home-model-overlay" href="/modeles/aeroprakt-a-22-foxbat/" aria-label="Ouvrir la fiche modèle : Aeroprakt A-22 (Foxbat)"></a>
            <div class="home-model-card-inner">
              <div class="home-model-media">
                <img src="/images/ulm/AeroPrakt-A22-Foxbat.jpg" alt="Aeroprakt A-22 Foxbat" loading="lazy" />
              </div>
              <div class="home-model-copy">
                <div class="home-model-topline">
                  <h3>Aeroprakt A-22 (Foxbat)</h3>
                  <span class="pill">Enrichie</span>
                </div>
                <p>Aeroprakt · Multiaxe · 2 places · Rotax 912 UL / 912 ULS · Croisière ~150 km/h</p>
                <div class="home-model-tags">
                  <a class="pill home-model-tag" href="/tags/stol/">stol</a>
                  <a class="pill home-model-tag" href="/tags/ecole/">ecole</a>
                  <a class="pill home-model-tag" href="/tags/aluminium/">aluminium</a>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </article>

          <article class="home-model-card">
            <a class="home-model-overlay" href="/modeles/aeroprakt-a-32-vixxen/" aria-label="Ouvrir la fiche modèle : Aeroprakt A-32 Vixxen"></a>
            <div class="home-model-card-inner">
              <div class="home-model-media">
                <img src="/images/ulm/AeroPrakt-A32-Vixxen.jpg" alt="Aeroprakt A-32 Vixxen" loading="lazy" />
              </div>
              <div class="home-model-copy">
                <div class="home-model-topline">
                  <h3>Aeroprakt A-32 Vixxen</h3>
                  <span class="pill">Enrichie</span>
                </div>
                <p>Aeroprakt · Multiaxe · 2 places · Rotax 912 ULS · Croisière ~175 km/h</p>
                <div class="home-model-tags">
                  <a class="pill home-model-tag" href="/tags/voyage/">voyage</a>
                  <a class="pill home-model-tag" href="/tags/rapide/">rapide</a>
                  <a class="pill home-model-tag" href="/tags/aluminium/">aluminium</a>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </article>

          <article class="home-model-card">
            <a class="home-model-overlay" href="/modeles/aerospool-wt9-dynamic/" aria-label="Ouvrir la fiche modèle : Aerospool WT9 Dynamic"></a>
            <div class="home-model-card-inner">
              <div class="home-model-media">
                <img src="/images/ulm/aerospool-wt9.jpg" alt="Aerospool WT9 Dynamic" loading="lazy" />
              </div>
              <div class="home-model-copy">
                <div class="home-model-topline">
                  <h3>Aerospool WT9 Dynamic</h3>
                  <span class="pill">Enrichie</span>
                </div>
                <p>Aerospool · Multiaxe · 2 places · Rotax 912 ULS</p>
                <div class="home-model-tags">
                  <a class="pill home-model-tag" href="/tags/voyage/">voyage</a>
                  <a class="pill home-model-tag" href="/tags/rapide/">rapide</a>
                  <a class="pill home-model-tag" href="/tags/composite/">composite</a>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </article>

          <article class="home-model-card">
            <a class="home-model-overlay" href="/modeles/autogyro-cavalon/" aria-label="Ouvrir la fiche modèle : AutoGyro Cavalon"></a>
            <div class="home-model-card-inner">
              <div class="home-model-media">
                <img src="/images/ulm/AutoGyroCavalon.jpg" alt="AutoGyro Cavalon" loading="lazy" />
              </div>
              <div class="home-model-copy">
                <div class="home-model-topline">
                  <h3>AutoGyro Cavalon</h3>
                  <span class="pill">Enrichie</span>
                </div>
                <p>AutoGyro GmbH · Autogire · 2 places · Rotax 915 iS</p>
                <div class="home-model-tags">
                  <a class="pill home-model-tag" href="/tags/voyage/">voyage</a>
                  <a class="pill home-model-tag" href="/tags/composite/">composite</a>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </article>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="container home-themes-section">
    <div class="card">
      <div class="pad home-themes-wrap">
        <div class="home-section-head home-section-head--tight">
          <div>
            <h2>Explorer par thèmes</h2>
            <p class="home-section-intro compact">
              Une entrée courte vers les sujets du journal et les profils de machines de l’annuaire.
            </p>
          </div>
          <a class="home-text-link" href="/tags/">Tous les tags</a>
        </div>

        <div class="home-theme-groups">
          <div class="home-theme-group">
            <strong>Journal</strong>
            <div class="home-theme-pills">
              <a class="pill" href="/tags/pilotage/">pilotage</a>
              <a class="pill" href="/tags/meteo/">météo</a>
              <a class="pill" href="/tags/securite/">sécurité</a>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="home-theme-group">
            <strong>Modèles ULM</strong>
            <div class="home-theme-pills">
              <a class="pill" href="/tags/voyage/">voyage</a>
              <a class="pill" href="/tags/ecole/">école</a>
              <a class="pill" href="/tags/polyvalent/">polyvalent</a>
              <a class="pill" href="/tags/stol/">stol</a>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <style is:global>
    .home-top-section {
      padding: 34px 0 18px;
    }

    .home-top-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.45fr) minmax(320px, 0.9fr);
      gap: 18px;
      align-items: start;
    }

    .home-hero-card {
      position: relative;
      overflow: hidden;
      padding: 24px;
      background:
        radial-gradient(1100px 560px at 0% 0%, rgba(125, 211, 252, 0.07), transparent 42%),
        radial-gradient(820px 360px at 100% 10%, rgba(167, 139, 250, 0.08), transparent 40%),
        linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(255,255,255,.04), rgba(255,255,255,.018));
    }

    .home-hero-mark {
      width: clamp(88px, 8vw, 108px);
      aspect-ratio: 1;
      margin: 2px 0 18px;
      border-radius: 26px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      background:
        radial-gradient(120% 120% at 30% 18%, rgba(125, 211, 252, 0.16), transparent 46%),
        linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.12), rgba(255,255,255,0.04));
      border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.11);
      box-shadow:
        inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,0.15),
        0 18px 40px rgba(5, 12, 18, 0.18),
        0 0 28px rgba(125, 211, 252, 0.05);
      pointer-events: none;
      position: relative;
      z-index: 1;
    }

    .home-hero-mark img {
      width: 70%;
      height: 70%;
      object-fit: contain;
      display: block;
      opacity: 0.8;
      filter: drop-shadow(0 10px 24px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.22));
    }

    .home-hero-card > * {
      position: relative;
      z-index: 1;
    }

    .home-kicker {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 8px;
      margin-bottom: 14px;
      font-size: 0.82rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: 0.08em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: rgba(139, 220, 255, 0.92);
    }

    .home-hero-card h1 {
      margin: 0;
      max-width: 11.5ch;
      line-height: 1.05;
      letter-spacing: -0.026em;
      font-size: clamp(1.74rem, 3.15vw, 2.95rem);
      text-wrap: balance;
    }

    .home-lead {
      margin: 16px 0 0;
      max-width: 50ch;
      font-size: 1rem;
      line-height: 1.7;
      color: rgba(231, 238, 247, 0.9);
    }

    .home-hero-actions {
      display: flex;
      gap: 12px;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      margin-top: 18px;
    }

    .home-primary-btn {
      background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(125,211,252,.24), rgba(125,211,252,.11));
      border-color: rgba(156,223,255,.44);
      box-shadow: 0 10px 24px rgba(24, 74, 102, 0.18);
    }

    .home-hero-links {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 10px;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      margin-top: 14px;
      font-size: 0.96rem;
      color: var(--muted);
    }

    .home-hero-links a {
      color: rgba(220, 236, 247, 0.9);
      text-decoration: none;
    }

    .home-hero-links a:hover {
      color: #8bdcff;
      text-decoration: none;
    }

    .home-hero-note {
      margin: 14px 0 0;
      max-width: 56ch;
      font-size: 0.92rem;
      line-height: 1.58;
      color: rgba(167, 182, 201, 0.95);
    }

    .home-journal-card .pad,
    .home-themes-wrap {
      display: grid;
      gap: 14px;
    }

    .home-section-head {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: flex-start;
      gap: 14px;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
    }

    .home-section-head--tight {
      margin-bottom: 2px;
    }

    .home-section-head h2 {
      margin: 0;
    }

    .home-section-intro {
      margin: 8px 0 0;
      color: var(--muted);
      line-height: 1.64;
      max-width: 70ch;
    }

    .home-section-intro.compact {
      margin-top: 6px;
      max-width: 54ch;
    }

    .home-text-link {
      color: rgba(220, 236, 247, 0.88);
      text-decoration: none;
      font-size: 0.94rem;
      white-space: nowrap;
    }

    .home-text-link:hover {
      color: #8bdcff;
      text-decoration: none;
    }

    .home-article-list {
      list-style: none;
      padding: 0;
      margin: 4px 0 0;
      display: grid;
      gap: 12px;
    }

    .home-article-item {
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
    }

    .home-article-link {
      display: block;
      color: inherit;
      text-decoration: none;
      padding: 14px 14px 15px;
      border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06);
      border-radius: 14px;
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02);
      transition:
        background-color 0.18s ease,
        border-color 0.18s ease,
        box-shadow 0.18s ease,
        transform 0.18s ease;
    }

    .home-article-link--with-thumb {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 116px minmax(0, 1fr);
      gap: 14px;
      align-items: start;
    }

    .home-article-link:hover,
    .home-article-link:focus-visible {
      background: rgba(139, 220, 255, 0.05);
      border-color: rgba(139, 220, 255, 0.16);
      box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 1px rgba(139, 220, 255, 0.10);
      transform: translateY(-1px);
      text-decoration: none;
    }

    .home-article-link:hover h3,
    .home-article-link:focus-visible h3 {
      color: #8bdcff;
    }

    .home-article-thumb {
      width: 116px;
      height: 68px;
      border-radius: 14px;
      overflow: hidden;
      border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06);
      background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(255,255,255,.06), rgba(255,255,255,.03));
      flex-shrink: 0;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      padding: 0;
    }

    .home-article-thumb img {
      width: 100%;
      height: 100%;
      object-fit: cover;
      display: block;
    }

    .home-article-thumb--logo {
      padding: 12px;
      background:
        radial-gradient(120% 120% at 30% 10%, rgba(125, 211, 252, 0.18), transparent 44%),
        linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(255,255,255,.08), rgba(255,255,255,.03));
    }

    .home-article-thumb--logo img {
      width: 100%;
      height: 100%;
      object-fit: contain;
    }

    .home-article-copy {
      min-width: 0;
    }

    .home-article-meta {
      display: flex;
      gap: 8px;
      align-items: center;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      margin-bottom: 8px;
      font-size: 0.78rem;
      color: var(--muted);
    }

    .home-article-highlight {
      color: #67d9ff;
      font-weight: 700;
    }

    .home-article-link h3 {
      margin: 0;
      font-size: 1rem;
      line-height: 1.4;
      transition: color 0.2s ease;
    }

    .home-article-link p {
      margin: 10px 0 0;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 0.94rem;
      line-height: 1.58;
      display: -webkit-box;
      -webkit-line-clamp: 3;
      -webkit-box-orient: vertical;
      overflow: hidden;
    }

    .home-model-section,
    .home-themes-section {
      padding: 8px 0 18px;
    }






    .home-model-grid {
      margin-top: 8px;
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(320px, 1fr));
      gap: 16px;
    }

    .home-model-card {
      position: relative;
      border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06);
      border-radius: 16px;
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02);
      transition:
        background-color 0.18s ease,
        border-color 0.18s ease,
        box-shadow 0.18s ease,
        transform 0.18s ease;
    }

    .home-model-card:hover,
    .home-model-card:focus-within {
      background: rgba(139, 220, 255, 0.05);
      border-color: rgba(139, 220, 255, 0.16);
      box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 1px rgba(139, 220, 255, 0.10);
      transform: translateY(-1px);
    }

    .home-model-overlay {
      position: absolute;
      inset: 0;
      z-index: 2;
      border-radius: 16px;
    }

    .home-model-card-inner {
      position: relative;
      z-index: 1;
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 132px minmax(0, 1fr);
      gap: 16px;
      padding: 16px;
      align-items: center;
    }

    .home-model-media {
      width: 132px;
      height: 84px;
      border-radius: 12px;
      overflow: hidden;
      background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.06), rgba(255,255,255,0.03));
      border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      padding: 6px;
    }

    .home-model-media img {
      width: 100%;
      height: 100%;
      object-fit: contain;
      display: block;
    }

    .home-model-copy {
      min-width: 0;
    }

    .home-model-topline {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: flex-start;
      gap: 10px;
    }

    .home-model-topline h3 {
      margin: 0;
      font-size: 1.02rem;
      line-height: 1.34;
      max-width: 16ch;
    }

    .home-model-copy p {
      margin: 7px 0 0;
      color: var(--muted);
      line-height: 1.52;
      font-size: 0.93rem;
      display: -webkit-box;
      -webkit-line-clamp: 3;
      -webkit-box-orient: vertical;
      overflow: hidden;
    }

    .home-model-tags {
      display: flex;
      gap: 8px;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      margin-top: 10px;
    }

    .home-model-tag {
      position: relative;
      z-index: 3;
      text-decoration: none;
    }

    .home-theme-groups {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
      gap: 14px;
      margin-top: 2px;
    }

    .home-theme-group {
      padding: 14px 16px;
      border-radius: 14px;
      border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06);
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02);
    }

    .home-theme-group strong {
      display: block;
      margin-bottom: 10px;
      font-size: 0.98rem;
    }

    .home-theme-pills {
      display: flex;
      gap: 10px;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
    }

    @media (max-width: 1100px) {
      .home-top-grid {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      }

      .home-hero-mark {
        width: 96px;
        margin-bottom: 16px;
      }
    }

    @media (max-width: 900px) {
      .home-model-grid,
      .home-theme-groups {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      }
    }

    @media (max-width: 720px) {
      .home-top-section {
        padding-top: 28px;
      }

      .home-hero-card {
        padding: 20px;
      }

      .home-hero-mark {
        width: 84px;
        margin-bottom: 16px;
        border-radius: 22px;
      }

      .home-hero-card h1 {
        max-width: none;
        padding-right: 0;
      }

      .home-journal-card .pad {
        gap: 12px;
      }

      .home-article-list {
        gap: 10px;
      }

      .home-article-link {
        padding: 12px;
      }

      .home-article-link--with-thumb {
        display: block;
      }

      .home-article-thumb {
        width: 100%;
        height: 132px;
        margin-bottom: 12px;
        border-radius: 12px;
      }

      .home-article-thumb--logo {
        padding: 16px;
      }

      .home-article-meta {
        margin-bottom: 6px;
      }

      .home-article-link h3 {
        font-size: 0.98rem;
        line-height: 1.38;
      }

      .home-article-link p {
        margin-top: 8px;
        -webkit-line-clamp: 2;
      }

      .home-theme-groups {
        gap: 10px;
      }

      .home-theme-group {
        padding: 12px 14px;
      }

      .home-theme-group strong {
        margin-bottom: 8px;
        font-size: 0.94rem;
      }

      .home-theme-pills {
        gap: 8px;
      }

      .home-themes-wrap {
        gap: 12px;
      }

      .home-themes-section .pad {
        padding: 18px;
      }

      .home-themes-section h2 {
        font-size: 1.55rem;
      }

      .home-themes-section .home-section-intro.compact {
        max-width: none;
        font-size: 0.95rem;
        line-height: 1.55;
      }

      .home-model-card-inner {
        grid-template-columns: 96px minmax(0, 1fr);
